function scannerMarkupContent(){
 const saved=scannerState(),definitions=Object.values(saved.data.definitions||{}),selected=definitions.find(d=>d.id===scannerSelectedId),runs=Object.values(saved.data.runs||{}).sort((a,b)=>String(b.created_at||b.requested_at||'').localeCompare(String(a.created_at||a.requested_at||'')));
 return '<details id="saved-data-scans" '+(scannerOpen?'open':'')+'><summary>Saved declarative data scans · '+definitions.length+' definitions · '+runs.length+' runs</summary><p>Saved scans combine existing Yahoo declarative selection and typed conditions with reusable causal multi-timeframe programs. Programs reuse exact saved chart formula revisions; they are not Pine scripts or trading strategies. Missing or incompatible inputs are unavailable, never a clean non-match. ALL is clear if any condition clears, otherwise unavailable if any input is unknown, otherwise matched. ANY is matched if any condition matches, otherwise unavailable if any input is unknown, otherwise clear. Partial coverage remains visible even when the aggregate is conclusive; only a conclusive clear rearms an attention latch. Legacy condition crossings compare actual observed runs; program crossings compare two actual aligned anchor observations.</p><p role="status">'+esc(scannerError||scannerPollError||(scannerBusy?'Reading/saving scan records…':discoveryMeta?.scanner?'Scan library revision '+saved.revision:'Scanner metadata unavailable; refresh or open discovery to load the installed schema'))+'</p><button id="scanner-refresh" '+(scannerBusy?'disabled':'')+'>Refresh saved definitions and jobs</button><div class="proposal-fields"><label>Saved definition<select id="scanner-definition"><option value="">Choose</option>'+definitions.map(d=>'<option value="'+esc(d.id)+'" '+(d.id===scannerSelectedId?'selected':'')+'>'+esc(d.name)+' · revision '+esc(d.revision)+(d.schedule?.enabled?' · schedule opted in':' · schedule off')+'</option>').join('')+'</select></label><button id="scanner-load" '+(!selected?'disabled':'')+'>Load exact definition into draft</button><button id="scanner-new">New draft · scheduling off</button></div>'+scannerProgramMarkup()+'<details><summary>Advanced declarative definition JSON</summary><div class="proposal-fields"><label>Declarative definition JSON<textarea id="scanner-definition-json" rows="24" spellcheck="false">'+esc(scannerDraftText||JSON.stringify(scannerTemplate(),null,2))+'</textarea></label></div></details><button id="scanner-sync-json">Apply advanced JSON to program controls</button><p>Fixed targets name symbols explicitly. Snapshot/Follow targets name a saved watchlist ID; membership is frozen and recorded for each run. Provider targets use the nested query. Set each indicator condition’s timeframe explicitly and declare max_intervals. Watchlist IDs: '+esc(watchlists.map(w=>w.id+' = '+w.name).join('; '))+'</p><details><summary>Installed complete Yahoo operators, fields, values and typed scan schema</summary><pre>'+esc(JSON.stringify(saved.schema,null,2))+'</pre></details><p>Programs and advanced JSON are schema-validated by the backend; nothing is evaluated as JavaScript or Python. Saving creates an immutable revision and disables scheduling. Editing does not change old runs. A definition’s source mode, feed, adjustment, lookback, symbol/page/request/interval and time bounds must be explicit.</p><label><input id="scanner-collection-consent" type="checkbox" '+(scannerCollectionConsent?'checked':'')+'> I explicitly authorize this selected definition’s declared provider collection for its next manual run or saved schedule. Retained-only scans do not collect.</label><label>Optional historical market cutoff / UTC ISO timestamp<input id="scanner-cutoff" value="'+esc(scannerCutoff)+'" placeholder="Blank uses current cutoff"></label><p>An older cutoff is retrospective unless original knowledge evidence proves otherwise. Capture and calculation times remain actual.</p><div class="row"><button id="scanner-save" '+(scannerBusy||!discoveryMeta?.scanner?'disabled':'')+'>Save immutable definition revision · schedule off</button><button id="scanner-run" '+(!selected||scannerBusy?'disabled':'')+'>Run selected saved revision once</button><button id="scanner-schedule-on" '+(!selected||selected.schedule?.enabled||scannerBusy?'disabled':'')+'>Explicitly opt in selected saved schedule</button><button id="scanner-schedule-off" '+(!selected?.schedule?.enabled||scannerBusy?'disabled':'')+'>Disable selected schedule</button></div>'+(selected?'<details><summary>Exact selected revision and collection/schedule authority</summary>'+scannerAuthority(selected)+'<pre>'+esc(JSON.stringify(selected,null,2))+'</pre></details>':'')+'<button id="scanner-export">Export selected revision or full scan library</button><label>Import validated scan / dependency bundle<input id="scanner-import" type="file" accept="application/json,.json"></label><p>Imported definitions require review and explicit schedule / attention opt-in.</p><p>Run and schedule actions use the selected saved revision, never the unsaved JSON draft. Cadence is elapsed UTC minutes; the America/New_York regular-session gate follows recorded calendar/DST. There is no restart catch-up. Each interval requires its own closed-by-cutoff and fresh observations, with no borrowed freshness. Jobs do not overlap the same definition. Cancel/time limits stop future dispatch; an in-flight provider call can finish. Restarted/stopped intervals have no backfill. A run cutoff is the frozen selection/dispatch boundary; provider capture may occur later and remains separately dated. max_requests bounds explicit provider dispatch operations; yfinance can internally make or retry more HTTP calls. Actual counters and partial-universe coverage belong to each run. Canceled or unprocessed work remains distinct from evaluated missing/failed inputs. Durable schedule slots and skipped overlaps remain inspectable. Optional attention events deduplicate matches; scanning does not start research, trade or send notifications automatically.</p><details><summary>Immutable definition revision history</summary><pre>'+esc(JSON.stringify(saved.data.definition_history||[],null,2))+'</pre></details><details><summary>Durable schedule slots, skipped overlaps and restart gaps</summary><pre>'+esc(JSON.stringify({schedule_slots:saved.data.schedule_slots||{},definitions:definitions.map(d=>({id:d.id,revision:d.revision,next_due_at:d.next_due_at,schedule_gaps:d.schedule_gaps}))},null,2))+'</pre></details><h4>Retained scan runs</h4>'+runs.map(run=>'<article><p>'+esc(run.id)+' · '+esc(run.status||'Status unavailable')+' · definition '+esc(run.definition_id||run.definition?.id||'Unavailable')+' revision '+esc(run.definition_revision??run.definition?.revision??'Unavailable')+'</p><button data-open-scanner-run="'+esc(run.id)+'">Inspect exact retained run</button>'+(['queued','running','cancelling'].includes(run.status)?'<button data-cancel-scanner-run="'+esc(run.id)+'">Cancel future work</button>':'')+'</article>').join('')+scannerRunMarkup()+'</details>';
}
function compactScannerMarkup(markup){
 const template=document.createElement('template');template.innerHTML=markup;const root=template.content.querySelector('#saved-data-scans');if(!root)return markup;
 const help=document.createElement('details');help.className='scan-details';help.innerHTML='<summary>Scan details</summary>';
 for(const paragraph of root.querySelectorAll('p:not([role])'))if(paragraph.textContent.length>200&&!paragraph.closest('article,[aria-label="Exact retained scan run"]'))help.append(paragraph);
 const actions=root.querySelector('#scanner-save')?.parentElement,advanced=root.querySelector('#scanner-definition-json')?.closest('details');
 if(advanced){advanced.querySelector('summary').textContent='Advanced definition / JSON';advanced.append(root.querySelector('#scanner-sync-json'));}
 const group=(title,ids)=>{const detail=document.createElement('details');detail.className='scan-details';detail.innerHTML='<summary>'+title+'</summary>';for(const id of ids){const control=root.querySelector('#'+id);if(control)detail.append(control.closest('label')||control);}actions?.before(detail);return detail;};
 group('Run source, collection consent, and scheduling',['scanner-collection-consent','scanner-cutoff','scanner-schedule-on','scanner-schedule-off']).insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<p>Run and schedule actions use the selected saved revision. Saving a draft leaves scheduling off. Provider collection requires explicit consent.</p>');
 group('Import and export',['scanner-export','scanner-import']);
 if(actions){actions.classList.add('scanner-actions');actions.prepend(document.createTextNode('Draft and saved revision actions '));}
 if(help.children.length>1)root.insertBefore(help,[...root.children].find(node=>node.tagName==='H4'&&node.textContent==='Retained scan runs')||null);
 const context=[activePage,scannerSelectedId,scannerState().data.definitions?.[scannerSelectedId]?.revision,scannerRun?.id,scannerResultKey,scannerObservation];root.querySelectorAll('details').forEach((detail,index)=>{detail.dataset.scannerDisclosure=JSON.stringify([...context,detail.querySelector('summary')?.textContent,index]);if(scannerDisclosures.has(detail.dataset.scannerDisclosure))detail.open=scannerDisclosures.get(detail.dataset.scannerDisclosure);});
 return template.innerHTML;
}
function scannerRunMarkup(){
 if(!scannerRun)return '';
 const run=scannerRun,rows=Object.values(run.results||{}).flatMap(result=>{
  const program=result.calculation?.result;
  if(program)return Object.entries(run.definition?.program?.inputs||{}).map(([name,selected])=>{
   const input=program.latest?.inputs?.[name],pin=run.source_pins?.[result.symbol]?.[name]?.artifact,axis=Object.values(program.axes||{}).find(axis=>(input?.source_sha256&&axis.source_sha256===input.source_sha256)||(pin?.sha256&&axis.source_pin?.sha256===pin.sha256));
   return {result,interval:name+' · '+selected.timeframe+' / '+selected.session,source:{...axis?.source,status:axis?.axis_status,complete:input?.coverage_complete===true,artifact:axis?.source_pin,input,axis_reasons:axis?.axis_reasons}};
  });
  const intervals=Object.entries(result.intervals||{});return (intervals.length?intervals:[['existing observations',null]]).map(([interval,source])=>({result,interval,source}));
 });
 let inspected=null;if(scannerResultKey){try{const [symbol,interval]=JSON.parse(decodeURIComponent(scannerResultKey)),row=rows.find(row=>row.result.symbol===symbol&&row.interval===interval);inspected={symbol,interval,result:run.results[symbol],source:row?.source??null};}catch{inspected={unavailable:'The selected retained result is unavailable'};}}
 return '<section aria-label="Exact retained scan run"><h4>Exact scan run '+esc(run.id)+'</h4><p>'+esc(run.status||'Unavailable')+' · frozen definition '+esc(run.definition?.id)+' revision '+esc(run.definition?.revision)+' · requested '+fullTime(run.requested_at)+' · market cutoff '+fullTime(run.cutoff)+' · '+esc(run.retrospective?'Retrospective / hindsight':'Current evaluation; see original availability evidence')+'</p><p>Frozen universe '+esc(run.universe?.mode)+' · '+esc(run.universe?.members?.length??'Unavailable')+' members · '+esc(run.universe?.complete===true?'complete selection':'partial/unverified selection')+' · resolved '+fullTime(run.universe?.resolved_at)+'</p><p>Evaluated counts: matched '+esc(run.counts?.matched??'Unavailable')+' / clear '+esc(run.counts?.clear??'Unavailable')+' / unavailable '+esc(run.counts?.unavailable??'Unavailable')+'. Overall coverage '+esc(run.coverage?.complete===true?'complete':'partial/unverified')+' · '+esc((run.coverage?.reasons||[]).join('; '))+'</p><p>Unprocessed (not evaluated as missing/clear): '+esc((run.unprocessed||[]).join(', ')||'None recorded')+' · explicit provider dispatch operations '+esc(run.provider_operations??'Unavailable')+'</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Symbol / aggregate</th><th>Interval / source availability</th><th>Coverage</th><th>Actual capture / source hash</th><th>Exact evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.map(({result,interval,source})=>'<tr><td>'+esc(result.symbol)+' · '+esc(result.state)+'</td><td>'+esc(interval)+' · '+esc(source?.status??'See retained observation evidence')+'</td><td>'+esc(result.coverage_complete===true?'complete':'partial/unverified')+' · interval '+esc(source?.complete===true?'complete':'partial/unverified')+'</td><td>'+fullTime(source?.captured_at)+'<br>'+esc(source?.artifact?.sha256??'No interval artifact')+'</td><td><button data-inspect-scanner-result="'+esc(encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify([result.symbol,interval])))+'">Inspect exact result</button></td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table></div>'+(inspected?scannerProgramEvidence(inspected.result)+'<details><summary>Selected run snapshot, frozen definition revision, condition facts and exact interval evidence</summary><pre>'+esc(JSON.stringify(inspected,null,2))+'</pre></details>':'')+'<details><summary>Full retained run, frozen definition, query receipts, slot identity and partial-coverage evidence</summary><pre>'+esc(JSON.stringify(run,null,2))+'</pre></details></section>';
}
async function scannerAction(action,extra={}){
 if(scannerBusy)return;scannerBusy=true;scannerError='';const selected=scannerState().data.definitions?.[scannerSelectedId];
 try{
  const request={action,...extra};if(action==='scan_save'){request.definition=scannerDefinition();request.expected_revision=scannerState().revision;}
  if(['scan_run','scan_schedule'].includes(action)){
   if(!selected)throw new Error('Select a saved immutable revision first.');request.id=selected.id;request.revision=selected.revision;if(action==='scan_run'&&scannerCutoff.trim())request.market_cutoff=scannerCutoff.trim();
   if(selected.collection?.mode==='collect'&&(action==='scan_run'||extra.enabled)&&!scannerCollectionConsent)throw new Error('Explicitly authorize the selected saved collection bounds before running or enabling its schedule.');
   if(action==='scan_schedule')request.expected_revision=scannerState().revision;
  }
  const response=await api('/api/discovery',request);
  if(action==='scan_export'){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(response.bundle,null,2)],{type:'application/json'})),link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download='scan-definitions.json';link.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);}
  else if(action==='scan_detail'){scannerRun=response.run;const runs=discoveryMeta?.scanner?.data?.runs;if(runs&&scannerRun)runs[scannerRun.id]=scannerRun;scannerResultKey='';scannerObservation=null;}
  else{discoveryMeta=response;if(action==='scan_import'&&response.workspace)adoptWorkspace(response.workspace);if(response.scanner?.saved_definition){const saved=response.scanner.saved_definition;scannerSelectedId=saved.id;if(action==='scan_save')scannerDraftText=JSON.stringify({...scannerDefinition(),id:saved.id,revision:saved.revision},null,2);scannerCollectionConsent=false;}}
 }catch(error){scannerError=error.message;}finally{scannerBusy=false;bindDiscovery();}
}
function bindScanner(){
 if($('saved-data-scans'))$('saved-data-scans').dataset.scannerBound='1';
 bindScannerProgram();
 $('saved-data-scans')?.addEventListener('toggle',e=>scannerOpen=e.target.open);
 $('scanner-definition')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{scannerSelectedId=e.target.value;scannerCollectionConsent=false;bindDiscovery();});
 $('scanner-definition-json')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{scannerDraftText=e.target.value;scannerCollectionConsent=false;const box=$('scanner-collection-consent');if(box)box.checked=false;});
 $('scanner-collection-consent')?.addEventListener('change',e=>scannerCollectionConsent=e.target.checked);
 $('scanner-new')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{scannerSelectedId='';scannerDraftText=JSON.stringify(scannerTemplate(),null,2);scannerCollectionConsent=false;scannerError='';bindDiscovery();});
 $('scanner-load')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const definition=scannerState().data.definitions?.[scannerSelectedId];if(definition){scannerDraftText=JSON.stringify({...definition,schedule:{...definition.schedule,enabled:false}},null,2);scannerCollectionConsent=false;bindDiscovery();}});
 $('scanner-refresh')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{if(scannerBusy)return;scannerBusy=true;try{discoveryMeta=await api('/api/discovery');scannerError='';scannerPollError='';}catch(error){scannerError=error.message;}finally{scannerBusy=false;bindDiscovery();}});
 $('scanner-save')?.addEventListener('click',()=>scannerAction('scan_save'));
 $('scanner-run')?.addEventListener('click',()=>scannerAction('scan_run'));
 $('scanner-schedule-on')?.addEventListener('click',()=>scannerAction('scan_schedule',{enabled:true}));
 $('scanner-schedule-off')?.addEventListener('click',()=>scannerAction('scan_schedule',{enabled:false}));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-open-scanner-run]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{scanTab='matches';scannerAction('scan_detail',{run_id:button.dataset.openScannerRun});}));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-cancel-scanner-run]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>scannerAction('scan_cancel',{run_id:button.dataset.cancelScannerRun})));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-inspect-scanner-result]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{scannerResultKey=button.dataset.inspectScannerResult;scannerObservation=null;bindDiscovery();}));
}
